$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0>Xaos" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other high atop the rest of the earth at the tips of majestic peaks.  Each team's flag is placed within view of any attempting thief, so keep your defense up and the first team to cap it 8 times takes the match.";
